 ## Endpoints
 
+### Import tickets: `POST /tickets/import`
+
+Send `{ "tickets": [...] }` with up to 5000 bodies accepted by `POST /tickets`.
+The response is 201 with `{ "created": 2, "ids": ["T-0001", "T-0002"] }`, in input order.
+An empty array succeeds with zero created tickets. The whole array is checked first: an invalid item
+returns 400 with its zero-based index in the error message, and no tickets, audit entries, notifications
+or IDs are consumed. Each created ticket has the usual creation audit entry and requester notification.
+The import body limit is 16 MiB (or `MAX_BODY_BYTES` if larger); other routes keep `MAX_BODY_BYTES`.
+
